OL,3,GNEWSAPrioritise young people or risk a
OL,4,A'lost generation', says Milburn, ahead
OL,5,Aof major report
OL,6,
OL,7,FAlmost one million people aged 16 to 24
OL,8,Fare not in education, employment or
OL,9,Ftraining (Neet) - a rate of 13%, which
OL,10,FMilburn wants to fall to 5% within a
OL,11,Fdecade
OL,13,FTo do that, he's proposing that
OL,14,Funder-25s should no longer be able to
OL,15,Fclaim the health element of universal
OL,16,Fcredit; lower rates of National
OL,17,FInsurance for employing young people;
OL,18,Fand more apprenticeships
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
